vFM Player - Optional OPK resources

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/OPK

Original FITOM instrument resources. Preserve filenames and use them only with a compatible configuration; selecting this folder does not select a player.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/OPK

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
